                            File that contains the UserDefinedResource.</xs:documentation>
                    </xs:annotation>
                </xs:element>
                <xs:element name="File" type="ern:File" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                    <xs:annotation>
                        <xs:documentation>A Composite containing details of a File containing the
                            UserDefinedResource that a DSP can obtain.</xs:documentation>
